msgid ""
"data/events_special_boons.xml.append$//event[@name=\"BOON_SELECT_OE_AUX_SHIELDS\"]/text"
msgstr ""
"From nowhere, you hear a voice speaking to you. \"Grant of [Auxiliary "
"Shielding] i-i-installed. Installed! Grant provides: A s-s-single layer of "
"energy shields, stacks with other energy shields. If -you- witness p-p-"
"previous challenger; provide thanks. I advise you -visit- me as well.\""

